From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bjarne <87858321+bjakra@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 16:50:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Play Integrity: let Graphite settings toggle exec-spawning
 for Play services

Grants org.graphite.parts write access to only the USE_EXEC_SPAWNING /
USE_EXEC_SPAWNING_NON_DEFAULT GosPackageState flags, same-user, so the "strong
integrity native hook" switch can disable exec-based spawning for
com.google.android.gms by itself (gated behind a warning with a countdown in the
settings app). Far narrower than the Settings app's grant; no other hardening.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>

---
 .../com/android/server/pm/GosPackageStatePermissions.java | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/services/core/java/com/android/server/pm/GosPackageStatePermissions.java b/services/core/java/com/android/server/pm/GosPackageStatePermissions.java
index 66a2b817c80a75d0f6bcc8bdaa912d2800536f5a..1cedb9b8314b5dd0559352b97fa982c74b47fa56 100644
--- a/services/core/java/com/android/server/pm/GosPackageStatePermissions.java
+++ b/services/core/java/com/android/server/pm/GosPackageStatePermissions.java
@@ -125,6 +125,14 @@ class GosPackageStatePermissions {
                 .readWriteFields(FIELD_PACKAGE_FLAGS)
                 .apply(GmsCompatApp.PKG_NAME, computer);
 
+        // Graphite (patch 0653): the Graphite settings app may toggle exec-spawning for sandboxed
+        // Google Play services, for the Play Integrity "strong integrity" native-hook option. That
+        // option is off by default and gated behind an in-app warning with a countdown. Scoped to
+        // the exec-spawning flags only (no other hardening) and same-user only (no cross-user).
+        builder()
+                .readWriteFlags(USE_EXEC_SPAWNING_NON_DEFAULT, USE_EXEC_SPAWNING)
+                .apply("org.graphite.parts", computer);
+
         @GosPackageStateFlag.Enum int[] settingsReadWriteFlags = {
                 ALLOW_ACCESS_TO_OBB_DIRECTORY,
                 BLOCK_NATIVE_DEBUGGING_NON_DEFAULT,
